{"id":"sen_al","lemma":"señal","pos":"noun","rank":689,"glosses":["sign","landmark","signal"],"ipa":"/seˈɲal/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"señales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-se%C3%B1al.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una clara señal.","en":"It's a dead giveaway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800929"},{"text":"Tom contestó con pelos y señales.","en":"Tom gave a detailed answer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805884"},{"text":"No vi la señal.","en":"I didn't see the sign.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636750"},{"text":"No me señales con el dedo.","en":"Don't point your finger at me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519143"},{"text":"Es una señal de los tiempos.","en":"It's a sign of the times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77951"}]}